const h3ActionRoleLabels={attacker:'공격자',defender:'방어자',target:'피격자',evader:'회피자',counterattacker:'반격자',other:'기타'};
const h3ActionBodyLabels={humanoid:'인간형',small_quadruped:'소형 사족형',quadruped:'사족형',flying:'비행형',tentacle:'촉수형',other:'기타'};
const h3ActionSourceLabels={internal_generated:'내부 생성',direct_upload:'직접 등록',blender_render:'Blender 제작',external_licensed:'외부 라이선스'};
const h3ActionStateLabels={available:'H3 사용 가능',needs_preparation:'준비 필요',rights_review_required:'권리 확인 필요'};
function fillH3ActionPresetControls(){const presets=h3ActionState.presets||{},categories=presets.categories||{},labels=presets.category_labels||{},category=$('#h3ActionCategory'),filter=$('#h3ActionFilterCategory'),selected=category?.value;if(category){category.innerHTML=Object.keys(categories).map(key=>`<option value="${esc(key)}">${esc(labels[key]||key)}</option>`).join('');if(selected&&categories[selected])category.value=selected;syncH3ActionTypes()}if(filter){const current=filter.value;filter.innerHTML='<option value="">전체 종류</option>'+Object.keys(categories).map(key=>`<option value="${esc(key)}">${esc(labels[key]||key)}</option>`).join('');if(current&&categories[current])filter.value=current}const roleOptions=(presets.participant_roles||[]).map(value=>`<option value="${esc(value)}">${esc(h3ActionRoleLabels[value]||value)}</option>`).join(''),bodyOptions=(presets.body_types||[]).map(value=>`<option value="${esc(value)}">${esc(h3ActionBodyLabels[value]||value)}</option>`).join('');for(const select of [$('#h3ActionARole'),$('#h3ActionBRole')].filter(Boolean))select.innerHTML=roleOptions;for(const select of [$('#h3ActionABody'),$('#h3ActionBBody')].filter(Boolean))select.innerHTML=bodyOptions;const bodyFilter=$('#h3ActionFilterBody'),currentBody=bodyFilter?.value;if(bodyFilter){bodyFilter.innerHTML='<option value="">전체 신체 유형</option>'+bodyOptions;if(currentBody)bodyFilter.value=currentBody}syncH3ActionParticipantFields()}
function syncH3ActionTypes(){const category=$('#h3ActionCategory')?.value||'',types=h3ActionState.presets?.categories?.[category]||[],select=$('#h3ActionType'),current=select?.value;if(!select)return;select.innerHTML=types.map(value=>`<option value="${esc(value)}">${esc(value)}</option>`).join('');if(types.includes(current))select.value=current}
function syncH3ActionParticipantFields(){const two=Number($('#h3ActionParticipantCount')?.value||1)===2;for(const label of [$('#h3ActionBRoleLabel'),$('#h3ActionBBodyLabel')].filter(Boolean))label.hidden=!two}
function syncH3ActionSourceFields(){const blender=$('#h3ActionSourceType')?.value==='blender_render';for(const field of $$('[data-blender-source-field]'))field.hidden=!blender}
function h3FilteredActionAssets(){const category=$('#h3ActionFilterCategory')?.value||'',count=$('#h3ActionFilterCount')?.value||'',body=$('#h3ActionFilterBody')?.value||'',source=$('#h3ActionFilterSource')?.value||'',state=$('#h3ActionFilterState')?.value||'';return(h3ActionState.assets||[]).filter(row=>(!category||row.category===category)&&(!count||String(row.participant_count)===count)&&(!source||row.source_type===source)&&(!state||row.availability_state===state)&&(!body||row.participant_a?.body_type===body||row.participant_b?.body_type===body))}
function h3ActionThumbnail(asset){
  return `<button type="button" class="h3-action-thumbnail" data-action-play="${esc(asset.action_asset_id)}" aria-label="${esc(asset.title)} 영상 재생"><img src="/api/h3/action-assets/${encodeURIComponent(asset.action_asset_id)}/thumbnail" alt="" width="480" height="270" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>▶ 영상 재생</span></button>`;
}
function playH3ActionAsset(id,trigger){
  const asset=(h3ActionState.assets||[]).find(row=>row.action_asset_id===id);if(!asset)return;
  document.querySelector('#h3ActionPlayer')?.close();
  const dialog=document.createElement('dialog');dialog.id='h3ActionPlayer';dialog.className='h3-action-player';
  const heading=document.createElement('h3');heading.id='h3ActionPlayerTitle';heading.textContent=asset.title;dialog.setAttribute('aria-labelledby',heading.id);
  const close=document.createElement('button');close.type='button';close.textContent='닫기';close.onclick=()=>dialog.close();
  const video=document.createElement('video');video.controls=true;video.playsInline=true;video.preload='none';video.src=`/api/h3/action-assets/${encodeURIComponent(id)}/video`;
  dialog.append(heading,close,video);document.body.append(dialog);
  dialog.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(event.target===dialog){const r=dialog.getBoundingClientRect();if(event.clientX<r.left||event.clientX>r.right||event.clientY<r.top||event.clientY>r.bottom)dialog.close()}});
  dialog.addEventListener('close',()=>{video.pause();video.removeAttribute('src');video.load();dialog.remove();if(trigger?.isConnected)trigger.focus()},{once:true});
  video.addEventListener('error',()=>note('영상을 불러오지 못했습니다. 자산 상태를 확인해 주세요.',true),{once:true});
  dialog.showModal();video.play().catch(()=>{});
}
function renderH3ActionAssets(){const box=$('#h3ActionAssetList'),assets=h3FilteredActionAssets(),total=(h3ActionState.assets||[]).length,summary=$('#h3ActionAssetSummary');if(summary)summary.textContent=`전체 ${total}개 · 표시 ${assets.length}개`;if(!box)return;if(!assets.length){box.className='h3-action-assets muted';box.textContent=total?'필터에 해당하는 액션 자산이 없습니다.':'등록된 액션 자산이 없습니다.';return}box.className='h3-action-assets';box.innerHTML=assets.map(asset=>{const media=asset.h3_media||{},rights=asset.rights_state||'rights_review_required',available=asset.availability_state||'rights_review_required',participants=`A ${actionParticipantLabel(asset.participant_a)}${asset.participant_b?` · B ${actionParticipantLabel(asset.participant_b)}`:''}`,blender=asset.blender_source||{},blenderMeta=asset.source_type==='blender_render'?`<span>Blender ${esc(blender.blender_version||'-')} · 프로젝트 ${esc(blender.project_file||'-')} · 씬 ${esc(blender.scene_name||'-')}</span><span>Blender 액션 ${esc(blender.action_name||'-')} · 렌더 ${esc(blender.render_engine||'-')}</span>`:'',stateOptions=Object.entries(h3ActionStateLabels).map(([value,label])=>`<option value="${value}" ${available===value?'selected':''}>${label}</option>`).join(''),rightsOptions=[['confirmed','확인 완료'],['rights_review_required','권리 확인 필요'],['rejected','사용 불가']].map(([value,label])=>`<option value="${value}" ${rights===value?'selected':''}>${label}</option>`).join('');return`<article class="h3-action-card ${asset.archived?'archived':''}" data-action-asset-id="${esc(asset.action_asset_id)}">${h3ActionThumbnail(asset)}<div class="h3-action-card-body"><div class="h3-action-card-head"><div><b>${esc(asset.title)}</b><small>${esc(asset.action_asset_id)} · ${esc(asset.reference_role)}</small></div><span class="pill ${asset.h3_usable?'on':''}">${esc(h3ActionStateLabels[available]||available)}</span></div><p>${esc(asset.description||'설명 없음')}</p><div class="h3-action-tags"><span>${esc(asset.category_label)} · ${esc(asset.action_type)}</span><span>${asset.participant_count}명 · ${esc(participants)}</span><span>무기 ${esc(asset.weapon_type||'none')} · ${esc(asset.handedness||'none')}</span><span>방향 ${esc(asset.attack_start_direction||'-')} → ${esc(asset.attack_end_direction||'-')} · 화면 ${esc(asset.screen_direction||'-')}</span><span>접촉 ${esc(asset.contact_type||'-')} · 카메라 ${esc(asset.camera?.angle||'-')} / ${esc(asset.camera?.framing||'-')}</span><span>${media.width||'-'}×${media.height||'-'} · ${media.fps||'-'}fps · ${media.duration_seconds||'-'}초 · ${esc(media.codec||'-')}</span><span>${esc(h3ActionSourceLabels[asset.source_type]||asset.source_type)} · 제작자 ${esc(asset.creator||'-')} · 라이선스 ${esc(asset.license_name||'-')}</span>${blenderMeta}<span>SHA-256 ${esc(String(asset.sha256||'').slice(0,24))}… · 등록 ${esc(formatTime(asset.created_at))}</span></div><div class="h3-action-status-controls"><label>권리<select data-action-rights>${rightsOptions}</select></label><label>사용 상태<select data-action-availability>${stateOptions}</select></label><label class="toggle"><input data-action-commercial type="checkbox" ${asset.commercial_use_confirmed?'checked':''}><span>상업 이용</span></label><label class="toggle"><input data-action-ai-reference type="checkbox" ${asset.ai_reference_use_confirmed?'checked':''}><span>AI 참조</span></label><label class="toggle"><input data-action-active type="checkbox" ${asset.active?'checked':''}><span>활성</span></label><button type="button" data-action-save>상태 저장</button><button type="button" class="danger" data-action-archive>${asset.archived?'보관 해제':'보관'}</button><button type="button" class="danger" data-action-delete>삭제</button></div>${asset.source_url?`<a href="${esc(asset.source_url)}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">원본 페이지 열기</a>`:''}<small>증빙: ${esc(asset.license_evidence||'기록 없음')}</small></div></article>`}).join('');box.querySelectorAll('[data-action-play]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>playH3ActionAsset(button.dataset.actionPlay,button));box.querySelectorAll('.h3-action-thumbnail img').forEach(img=>img.addEventListener('error',()=>{img.hidden=true},{once:true}));box.querySelectorAll('[data-action-save]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>saveH3ActionStatus(button.closest('[data-action-asset-id]')));box.querySelectorAll('[data-action-archive]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>toggleH3ActionArchive(button.closest('[data-action-asset-id]')));box.querySelectorAll('[data-action-delete]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>deleteH3ActionAsset(button.closest('[data-action-asset-id]'),button))}
async function saveH3ActionStatus(card){const id=card?.dataset.actionAssetId;if(!id)return;try{await api(`/api/h3/action-assets/${encodeURIComponent(id)}`,{method:'PATCH',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({rights_state:card.querySelector('[data-action-rights]').value,availability_state:card.querySelector('[data-action-availability]').value,commercial_use_confirmed:card.querySelector('[data-action-commercial]').checked,ai_reference_use_confirmed:card.querySelector('[data-action-ai-reference]').checked,active:card.querySelector('[data-action-active]').checked})});await refreshH3ActionAssets();note('액션 자산 권리·사용 상태를 저장했습니다.')}catch(error){note(error.message,true)}}
async function toggleH3ActionArchive(card){const id=card?.dataset.actionAssetId,asset=(h3ActionState.assets||[]).find(row=>row.action_asset_id===id);if(!asset)return;try{await api(`/api/h3/action-assets/${encodeURIComponent(id)}`,{method:'PATCH',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({archived:!asset.archived,active:asset.archived})});await refreshH3ActionAssets();note(asset.archived?'액션 자산 보관을 해제했습니다.':'액션 자산을 보관했습니다.')}catch(error){note(error.message,true)}}
async function deleteH3ActionAsset(card,button){
  const id=card?.dataset.actionAssetId,asset=(h3ActionState.assets||[]).find(row=>row.action_asset_id===id);
  if(!asset||!confirm(`“${asset.title}” 액션 자산을 삭제할까요?\n\n목록과 새 작업의 선택 항목에서 제거됩니다. 영상 파일은 기존 작업과 복구를 위해 보존됩니다.`))return;
  try{
    button.disabled=true;
    await api(`/api/h3/action-assets/${encodeURIComponent(id)}`,{method:'DELETE'});
    await refreshH3ActionAssets();
    note('액션 자산을 삭제했습니다. 영상 파일은 복구용으로 보존됩니다.');
  }catch(error){note(error.message,true)}finally{button.disabled=false}
}
async function refreshH3ActionAssets(){h3ActionState=await api('/api/h3/action-assets');fillH3ActionPresetControls();fillH3ActionChoices();renderH3ActionAssets();return h3ActionState}
function h3ActionFormPayload(form){const values=new FormData(form),direction=String(values.get('attack_direction')||'').split('→').map(value=>value.trim()),two=Number(values.get('participant_count'))===2,sourceType=values.get('source_type');return{title:values.get('title'),description:values.get('description'),category:values.get('category'),action_type:values.get('action_type'),participant_count:two?2:1,participant_a:{role:values.get('participant_a_role'),body_type:values.get('participant_a_body')},participant_b:two?{role:values.get('participant_b_role'),body_type:values.get('participant_b_body')}:null,handedness:values.get('handedness'),weapon_type:values.get('weapon_type'),attack_start_direction:direction[0]||'',attack_end_direction:direction[1]||'',screen_direction:values.get('screen_direction'),contact_type:values.get('contact_type'),camera:{angle:values.get('camera_angle'),framing:values.get('camera_framing')},timing:{description:values.get('timing')},source_type:sourceType,blender_source:sourceType==='blender_render'?{project_file:values.get('blender_project_file'),scene_name:values.get('blender_scene_name'),action_name:values.get('blender_action_name'),blender_version:values.get('blender_version'),render_engine:values.get('blender_render_engine')}:null,source_url:values.get('source_url'),creator:values.get('creator'),license_name:values.get('license_name'),license_evidence:values.get('license_evidence'),downloaded_at:values.get('downloaded_at'),commercial_use_confirmed:values.get('commercial_use_confirmed')==='on',ai_reference_use_confirmed:values.get('ai_reference_use_confirmed')==='on'} }
function resetH3ActionRerenderMode(){const form=$('#h3ActionUploadForm'),video=form?.elements.video,button=form?.querySelector('button[type="submit"],button.primary.alt');if(!form)return;delete form.dataset.rerenderJobId;if(video){video.disabled=false;video.required=true;video.value=''}if(button)button.textContent='원본 보존 · H3용 무음 사본 준비 · 등록';syncH3ActionSourceFields()}
function stageH3RerenderActionRegistration(jobId,title){const form=$('#h3ActionUploadForm');if(!form)return;goPage('action-assets');form.dataset.rerenderJobId=jobId;form.elements.title.value=title;form.elements.source_type.value='direct_upload';syncH3ActionSourceFields();const video=form.elements.video;video.disabled=true;video.required=false;const button=form.querySelector('button[type="submit"],button.primary.alt');if(button)button.textContent='완료된 1024×576 결과를 액션 자산으로 등록';form.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});note('분류·참가자·동작 메타데이터를 확인한 뒤 등록하세요.')}
$('#h3ActionUploadForm')?.addEventListener('submit',async event=>{event.preventDefault();const form=event.currentTarget,button=event.submitter;try{if(button)button.disabled=true;const payload=h3ActionFormPayload(form),rerenderJobId=form.dataset.rerenderJobId;if(rerenderJobId){payload.rerender_job_id=rerenderJobId;await api('/api/h3/action-assets/from-rerender',{method:'POST',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(payload)})}else{const file=form.elements.video.files?.[0];if(!file)throw Error('등록할 액션 원본 영상을 선택하세요.');const body=new FormData();body.set('data',JSON.stringify(payload));body.set('video',file);await api('/api/h3/action-assets',{method:'POST',body})}form.reset();resetH3ActionRerenderMode();await refreshH3ActionAssets();note('액션 자산을 등록했습니다.')}catch(error){note(error.message,true)}finally{if(button)button.disabled=false}});
$('#h3ActionCategory')?.addEventListener('change',syncH3ActionTypes);$('#h3ActionParticipantCount')?.addEventListener('change',syncH3ActionParticipantFields);$('#h3ActionSourceType')?.addEventListener('change',syncH3ActionSourceFields);$('#refreshH3ActionAssets')?.addEventListener('click',()=>refreshH3ActionAssets().catch(error=>note(error.message,true)));for(const select of [$('#h3ActionFilterCategory'),$('#h3ActionFilterCount'),$('#h3ActionFilterBody'),$('#h3ActionFilterSource'),$('#h3ActionFilterState')].filter(Boolean))select.addEventListener('change',renderH3ActionAssets);syncH3ActionSourceFields();
const renderH3ResultsWithoutActionAssets=renderH3Results;
renderH3Results=function(){renderH3ResultsWithoutActionAssets();document.querySelectorAll('#h3SelectedResults [data-h3-selected-job]').forEach(article=>{const selectedJobId=article.dataset.h3SelectedJob,set=(h3State.candidate_sets||[]).find(row=>h3SelectedJobs(row).some(item=>item.job_id===selectedJobId));if(!set||set.project_kind!=='action_asset_project'||set.generation_mode==='i2v')return;const selected=h3SelectedResolutionRerender(selectedJobId),job=selected?.jobId?h3Job(selected.jobId):null,request=job?.request||{},ready=job?.status?.status==='completed'&&Number(request.width)===1024&&Number(request.height)===576,label=ready?'액션 자산으로 등록':'1024×576 완료 후 등록 가능',button=`<button type="button" class="primary h3-register-action-result" data-register-action-rerender="${esc(selected?.jobId||'')}" ${ready?'':'disabled'}>${label}</button>`;article.querySelector('.h3-result-details')?.insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin',button)});document.querySelectorAll('[data-register-action-rerender]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{const article=button.closest('[data-h3-selected-job]'),selectedJobId=article?.dataset.h3SelectedJob||'',set=(h3State.candidate_sets||[]).find(row=>h3SelectedJobs(row).some(item=>item.job_id===selectedJobId));stageH3RerenderActionRegistration(button.dataset.registerActionRerender,`${set?.source_clip_id||selectedJobId} 액션`)})};
window.addEventListener('pagehide',clearH3PicturePreviewSource);
bindH3SourceFilterControls('candidates');
bindH3SourceFilterControls('results');
$('#refreshH3Candidates')?.addEventListener('click',()=>refreshH3State(true).then(()=>note('H3 후보 목록을 새로고침했습니다.')).catch(error=>note(error.message,true)));
$('#forceStopH3CandidatePage')?.addEventListener('click',()=>forceStopH3CandidatePage());
$('#deleteH3CandidatePage')?.addEventListener('click',()=>deleteH3CandidatePage());
$('#refreshH3Results')?.addEventListener('click',()=>refreshH3State(true).then(()=>note('H3 선택 결과를 새로고침했습니다.')).catch(error=>note(error.message,true)));
$('#refresh')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{refreshPrimaryState().catch(error=>note(error.message,true));refreshSystemMetrics()});
let initialPage=(location.hash||'#create').slice(1);if(!document.querySelector(`nav button[data-page="${initialPage}"]`))initialPage='create';goPage(initialPage);
startSystemMetricsPolling();
refreshPrimaryState().catch(error=>note(error.message,true)).finally(connectStateEvents);
refreshH3ActionAssets().catch(()=>{});
